---
import { ShieldCheck, FileCheck, KeyRound } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 bg-[#23150F] text-[#FAF7F2] overflow-hidden">
  {/* Atmospheric architectural watermark with Parallax */}
  <div class="absolute -right-24 -bottom-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-[#C85A32]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" data-parallax="0.12" />
  <div class="absolute -left-24 -top-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-[#351F16]/50 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" data-parallax="-0.12" />

  <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    
    {/* Subtle seal */}
    <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 mb-8 scroll-reveal-down">
      <ShieldCheck className="w-8 h-8 text-[#C85A32]" />
    </div>

    {/* Section Eyebrow */}
    <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-semibold text-[#C85A32] mb-4 scroll-reveal-down delay-75">
      Filosofia Proprietária
    </span>

    {/* Big Hero Quote */}
    <blockquote class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#FAF7F2] leading-tight mb-8 scroll-reveal-up delay-150">
      “Só é dono quem <span class="italic text-[#C85A32] font-normal">registra</span>.”
    </blockquote>

    {/* Narrative Paragraph */}
    <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-xl text-white/80 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-12 scroll-reveal-up delay-200">
      Comprar um imóvel vai muito além de assinar uma promessa de compra e venda. Segurança jurídica significa entender cada certidão, antecipar riscos tributários e garantir que o cartório formalize a sua posse como propriedade plena.
    </p>

    {/* 3 Step Badge Flow - Mobile Slide / Desktop Grid */}
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
      <div
        id="philosophy-slider"
        class="flex overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-smooth no-scrollbar -mx-4 px-4 sm:mx-0 sm:px-0 gap-4 pb-2 sm:pb-0 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6 sm:overflow-visible"
      >
        <div class="w-[82vw] max-w-[320px] shrink-0 snap-center sm:w-auto sm:max-w-none sm:shrink sm:snap-align-none p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 text-left flex flex-col justify-between scroll-reveal-left delay-100 card-dynamic hover:border-[#C85A32]/40">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[#C85A32] font-mono text-xs font-semibold mb-2">01. DECISÃO</div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg text-white mb-2">Interesse & Seleção</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
              Encontrar o endereço ideal e conferir a real situação legal e estrutural do imóvel.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="w-[82vw] max-w-[320px] shrink-0 snap-center sm:w-auto sm:max-w-none sm:shrink sm:snap-align-none p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 text-left flex flex-col justify-between scroll-reveal-down delay-200 card-dynamic hover:border-[#C85A32]/40">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[#C85A32] font-mono text-xs font-semibold mb-2">02. SEGURANÇA</div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg text-white mb-2">Documentação & Crédito</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
              Auditoria de certidões negativas, estruturação do contrato e aprovação de financiamento.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="w-[82vw] max-w-[320px] shrink-0 snap-center sm:w-auto sm:max-w-none sm:shrink sm:snap-align-none p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 text-left flex flex-col justify-between scroll-reveal-right delay-300 card-dynamic hover:border-[#C85A32]/40">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[#C85A32] font-mono text-xs font-semibold mb-2">03. PATRIMÔNIO</div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg text-white mb-2">Escritura & Registro</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
              Lavratura no Cartório de Notas e averbação no Cartório de Registro de Imóveis (RGI).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Mobile Slide Dots Indicator */}
      <div class="flex sm:hidden items-center justify-center space-x-2 mt-4" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="w-6 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C85A32] transition-all duration-300 philosophy-dot"></span>
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 philosophy-dot"></span>
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 philosophy-dot"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Bottom statement */}
    <div class="mt-12 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40">
      Tatiana Cavalcanti • CRECI 8988 • Te guio do interesse ao registro
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const slider = document.getElementById('philosophy-slider');
  const dots = document.querySelectorAll('.philosophy-dot');

  if (slider && dots.length > 0) {
    slider.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const scrollPosition = slider.scrollLeft;
      const cardWidth = (slider.firstElementChild as HTMLElement)?.clientWidth || 300;
      const activeIndex = Math.min(
        dots.length - 1,
        Math.max(0, Math.round(scrollPosition / (cardWidth + 16)))
      );
      
      dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
        if (index === activeIndex) {
          dot.classList.add('bg-[#C85A32]', 'w-6');
          dot.classList.remove('bg-white/20', 'w-1.5');
        } else {
          dot.classList.remove('bg-[#C85A32]', 'w-6');
          dot.classList.add('bg-white/20', 'w-1.5');
        }
      });
    }, { passive: true });
  }
</script>
